@@ -79,6 +79,16 @@ Enrollment grants dashboard visibility only. A Fusion node can synchronize,
 buy tickets and produce blocks without being enrolled here. Independent owners
 retain their signing keys and fund their own tickets.
 
+## Total enrollment limit
+
+`COLLECTOR_MAX_NODES` is required at collector startup and limits the entire
+credential roster, including currently disconnected operators. An identity with
+two rotation credentials counts once. An oversized roster stops before listening.
+Set the writer's `SNAPSHOT_MAX_NODES` at least as high and coordinate the byte
+budgets using [head/enrollment limits](head-and-enrollment-limits.md). The tested
+eight-identity profile is a candidate, not a cap on Fusion validators. Increasing
+this dashboard roster needs sizing review; it does not require a consensus change.
+
 ## Validation and remaining boundaries
 
 `npm test` runs credential and handler/session contracts with fake transports
